# welcome-cta-click (h10-page): the button's centre (about (233, 553));
# the click navigates to #function-viewer with an empty query; the shot 2 s
# later: the viewer at its defaults. Behaviour: the route and url lines.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
click 233 553
wait 2000
shot welcome-cta-click
